descriptionFull:
Privacy is finally being integrated in web3 wallets. It's a long road, and there are many practical hurdles left to solve. In this panel, we'll discuss what several wallets are doing to solve privacy's last-mile problem. From onchain privacy to network-level privacy, Tor integration, address and amount correlations, private wallet recovery, and dealing with the problem of intermediaries learning of your transaction before it gets onchain.

Speakers:
@rsquare (Safe)
@LucemansNL (Ethereum Foundation)
@apoorveth (WalletChan)
@sethforprivacy (Cake Wallet)
@polymutex (moderator)
